@MelvinBot what do you think of fixing this in getTagArrayFromName.

https://github.com/Expensify/App/blob/da0cf969340f29c42c1d7b86a2918b0a0e40b37d/src/libs/TransactionUtils/index.ts#L890-L891

Instead of replacing the double slashes first, we replace the escaped colons first.

```
const tagWithoutEscapedColons = tagName.replaceAll('\\:', '☢');
const tagWithoutDoubleSlashes = tagWithoutEscapedColons.replaceAll('\\\\', '☠');
```

Will that cause any regression with real multi level tags?
